{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cIc2fzLfEi1793617178.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山明德山分行高級資深分區營業董事歐陽嘉俊表示，西營盤眀徳山再錄租賃成交，分行促成低層G室租賃成交，實用面積390平方呎，屬1房1套間隔，向西，望學校景，與前方高樓保持了一定距離，沒有壓迫感。單位最新以月租24,800元租出，折合實用呎租63.6元。</p><p> </p><p>歐陽嘉俊表示，新租客為來港多年的專才，心儀區內居住環境及生活氛圍，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2015年12月以825萬元一手購入單位，持貨11年，是次出租可享約3.6厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:45.978867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:22.796982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:37.660370+00:00","content_hash":"c070402d06f0a0138381a862f393652c564ea1612b38224bc51dd9a115af5078","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:45.978867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}